# project: technical-book-contract
VAR structural_revisions = 0

=== outline ===
Draft the full book outline: chapter list, scope, and audience framing.
Done when the outline is complete enough for the editor to judge the book's shape.
+ [Outline ready for the editor] -> outline_approval

=== outline_approval ===
The editor reviews the outline against the contract.
* [Editor approves the outline] @human -> draft_batch
+ [Editor requests outline changes] @human ~loop~ -> outline

=== draft_batch ===
Draft the next batch of chapters against the approved outline.
Done when the batch is coherent enough to hand to tech reviewers.
+ [Batch ready for tech review] -> tech_review

=== tech_review ===
Tech reviewers read the current batch and return findings.
A batch may take as many review rounds as it needs.
+ [Reviewers request fixes] ~loop~ -> fix_batch
+ [Batch passes; more batches remain] ~loop~ -> draft_batch
* [All chapters are through review] -> manuscript_review

=== fix_batch ===
Apply the tech reviewers' fixes to the current batch.
+ [Fixes applied; resubmit to reviewers] ~loop~ -> tech_review

=== manuscript_review ===
The full manuscript goes to the editor for acceptance.
The contract allows at most one structural-revision round.
+ [Editor accepts the manuscript] @human -> production
+ {structural_revisions < 1} [Editor requests structural revision] @human -> structural_revision
+ {structural_revisions >= 1} [Still not landing after revision] @human -> walk_away_decision

=== structural_revision ===
Rework the manuscript's structure per the editor's notes.
~ structural_revisions += 1
+ [Revision complete; resubmit to editor] ~loop~ -> manuscript_review

=== walk_away_decision ===
Joint call between author and agent: exercise the contract's walk-away clause
with the advance split, or find a path forward with the editor.
* [Walk away; split the advance] @human -> END
+ [Keep working with the editor] @human ~loop~ -> manuscript_review

=== production ===
Copyedit, typesetting, and proofs.
Done when final proofs are ready for author sign-off.
* [Proofs approved] @human -> publication

=== publication ===
The book is published and the contract is fulfilled.
-> END
